# abba.sh model preset: copy, edit, pass the path as abba.sh's second argument. Sourced by bash.
#
#   MODEL   model file (required)
#   ARGS    llama-bench flags for this model (array); abba.sh adds -m, -p, -n, -d, -r and -o jsonl
#   MEM_GB  MemAvailable (GB) that must hold before each cell: the model's resident size plus a few GB
#           for context and compute buffers. Read it once from `free -g` while the model is loaded.
# Optional (environment wins over the preset when both set them):
#   PP      prompt tokens per test (default 2048)
#   DEPTHS  -d list (default 0,8192,32768)
#   NGEN    tg tokens after each prefill (default 32)
#   REPS    -r inside each launch (default 2)

MODEL=/path/to/model.gguf
ARGS=(-ngl 99 -fa 1 -b 2048 -ub 2048)
MEM_GB=24

# Dense models often prefer a smaller ubatch; MoE models a large one. Keep one preset per model and recipe.
# PP=2048
# DEPTHS=0,8192,32768
